desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Tls Renegotiation"
	title_zh: "Tls Renegotiation"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-tls-renegotiation"
	risk: "insecure-tls"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Checks for cases where java applications are allowing unsafe renegotiation. This leaves the application vulnerable to a man-in-the-middle attack where chosen plain text is injected as prefix to a TLS connection.

### 风险类型
不安全的 TLS 配置（insecure-tls）

### 影响
使用旧版 TLS/SSL 或关闭强制 HTTPS，通信可能被降级或窃听。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-319: Cleartext Transmission of Sensitive Information
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
启用 TLS 1.2+，强制 HTTPS，并关闭不安全的协议版本。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.java": <<<POS
java.lang.System.setProperty("sun.security.ssl.allowUnsafeRenegotiation", true);
POS
	"safefile://pos.java": <<<NEG
java.lang.System.setProperty("sun.security.ssl.allowUnsafeRenegotiation", false);
NEG
)

${*.java}.pattern_regex(/(?:java\.lang\.System\.setProperty\("sun\.security\.ssl\.allowUnsafeRenegotiation",\s+true\);)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Tls Renegotiation",
	title_zh: "Tls Renegotiation",
	message: "Tls Renegotiation detected.",
}
